{"2897150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "All A Broadside", "steam_appid": 2897150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4903400], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All A Broadside is a sandbox sailing RPG - experience life on the high seas in a large open world. Gather a willing goblin crew, navigate treacherous waters, sink pirates, capture merchants, and expand your influence by befriending or plundering towns.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sailing Physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set and furl your physically simulated sails with controls that are simple to learn, and rewarding to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897150/extras/1f5fa4a9d7b5d77f6817f43f891afb21.poster.avif?t=1787054686\" aria-label=\"Video of ship turning with only front sails\" width=780 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897150/extras/1f5fa4a9d7b5d77f6817f43f891afb21.webm?t=1787054686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897150/extras/1f5fa4a9d7b5d77f6817f43f891afb21.mp4?t=1787054686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight or Flight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail, fight, dock and explore in a large open world. Consider the wind when planning your voyage or engaging in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897150/extras/4b45e42762a837c6ee87b3e301644908.poster.avif?t=1787054686\" width=780 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897150/extras/4b45e42762a837c6ee87b3e301644908.webm?t=1787054686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897150/extras/4b45e42762a837c6ee87b3e301644908.mp4?t=1787054686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Goblin Crew</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire &amp; befriend a cast of goblin NPCs, learn their skills, dispositions &amp; desires. Assign your most loyal crew to captain ships and govern towns, but choose wisely as you may just have handed over a ship to your newest rival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Open World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave your mark in this free-form open world sandbox. Join or clash with warlords, pirates and trading companies as they squabble over control of land and sea. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All A Broadside is a sandbox sailing RPG - experience life on the high seas in a large open world. Gather a willing goblin crew, navigate treacherous waters, sink pirates, capture merchants, and expand your influence by befriending or plundering towns.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sailing Physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set and furl your physically simulated sails with controls that are simple to learn, and rewarding to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897150/extras/1f5fa4a9d7b5d77f6817f43f891afb21.poster.avif?t=1787054686\" aria-label=\"Video of ship turning with only front sails\" width=780 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897150/extras/1f5fa4a9d7b5d77f6817f43f891afb21.webm?t=1787054686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897150/extras/1f5fa4a9d7b5d77f6817f43f891afb21.mp4?t=1787054686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight or Flight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail, fight, dock and explore in a large open world. Consider the wind when planning your voyage or engaging in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897150/extras/4b45e42762a837c6ee87b3e301644908.poster.avif?t=1787054686\" width=780 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897150/extras/4b45e42762a837c6ee87b3e301644908.webm?t=1787054686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897150/extras/4b45e42762a837c6ee87b3e301644908.mp4?t=1787054686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Goblin Crew</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire &amp; befriend a cast of goblin NPCs, learn their skills, dispositions &amp; desires. Assign your most loyal crew to captain ships and govern towns, but choose wisely as you may just have handed over a ship to your newest rival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Open World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave your mark in this free-form open world sandbox. Join or clash with warlords, pirates and trading companies as they squabble over control of land and sea. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A free-form sandbox sailing RPG featuring a large open world, detailed sailing physics, and emergent NPC simulation. Make friends and enemies as you set sail with your goblin crew - but life at sea only ever ends in two ways... fortune or ruin.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>langu